   2:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @file    stm32f4xx_adc.c
   4:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @version V1.8.0
   6:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @date    04-November-2016
   7:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @brief   This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   8:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *          functionalities of the Analog to Digital Convertor (ADC) peripheral:
   9:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Initialization and Configuration (in addition to ADC multi mode 
  10:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *             selection)
  11:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Analog Watchdog configuration
  12:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Temperature Sensor & Vrefint (Voltage Reference internal) & VBAT
  13:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *             management 
  14:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Regular Channels Configuration
  15:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Regular Channels DMA Configuration
  16:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Injected channels Configuration
  17:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *           + Interrupts and flags management
  18:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *         
  19:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   @verbatim
  20:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
  21:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  22:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
  23:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]
  24:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     (#) Enable the ADC interface clock using 
  25:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         RCC_APB2PeriphClockCmd(RCC_APB2Periph_ADCx, ENABLE); 
  26:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        
  27:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     (#) ADC pins configuration
  28:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) Enable the clock for the ADC GPIOs using the following function:
  29:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              RCC_AHB1PeriphClockCmd(RCC_AHB1Periph_GPIOx, ENABLE);   
  30:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) Configure these ADC pins in analog mode using GPIO_Init();  
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccMH9tzV.s 			page 2


  31:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
  32:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      (#) Configure the ADC Prescaler, conversion resolution and data 
  33:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          alignment using the ADC_Init() function.
  34:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      (#) Activate the ADC peripheral using ADC_Cmd() function.
  35:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
  36:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      *** Regular channels group configuration ***
  37:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      ============================================
  38:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      [..]    
  39:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To configure the ADC regular channels group features, use 
  40:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            ADC_Init() and ADC_RegularChannelConfig() functions.
  41:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To activate the continuous mode, use the ADC_continuousModeCmd()
  42:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            function.
  43:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To configurate and activate the Discontinuous mode, use the 
  44:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            ADC_DiscModeChannelCountConfig() and ADC_DiscModeCmd() functions.
  45:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To read the ADC converted values, use the ADC_GetConversionValue()
  46:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            function.
  47:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
  48:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      *** Multi mode ADCs Regular channels configuration ***
  49:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      ======================================================
  50:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      [..]
  51:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) Refer to "Regular channels group configuration" description to
  52:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            configure the ADC1, ADC2 and ADC3 regular channels.        
  53:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) Select the Multi mode ADC regular channels features (dual or 
  54:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            triple mode) using ADC_CommonInit() function and configure 
  55:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            the DMA mode using ADC_MultiModeDMARequestAfterLastTransferCmd() 
  56:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            functions.        
  57:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) Read the ADCs converted values using the 
  58:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            ADC_GetMultiModeConversionValue() function.
  59:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
  60:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      *** DMA for Regular channels group features configuration ***
  61:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      ============================================================= 
  62:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      [..]
  63:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To enable the DMA mode for regular channels group, use the 
  64:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            ADC_DMACmd() function.
  65:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To enable the generation of DMA requests continuously at the end
  66:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            of the last DMA transfer, use the ADC_DMARequestAfterLastTransferCmd() 
  67:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            function.
  68:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
  69:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      *** Injected channels group configuration ***
  70:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      =============================================    
  71:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      [..]
  72:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To configure the ADC Injected channels group features, use 
  73:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            ADC_InjectedChannelConfig() and  ADC_InjectedSequencerLengthConfig()
  74:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            functions.
  75:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To activate the continuous mode, use the ADC_continuousModeCmd()
  76:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            function.
  77:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To activate the Injected Discontinuous mode, use the 
  78:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            ADC_InjectedDiscModeCmd() function.  
  79:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To activate the AutoInjected mode, use the ADC_AutoInjectedConvCmd() 
  80:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            function.        
  81:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****        (+) To read the ADC converted values, use the ADC_GetInjectedConversionValue() 
  82:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            function.
  83:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
  84:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     @endverbatim
  85:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
  86:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @attention
