 182:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /** @defgroup ADC_Group1 Initialization and Configuration functions
 183:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *  @brief    Initialization and Configuration functions 
 184:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *
 185:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @verbatim    
 186:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 187:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****               ##### Initialization and Configuration functions #####
 188:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 189:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
 190:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Initialize and configure the ADC Prescaler
 191:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) ADC Conversion Resolution (12bit..6bit)
 192:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Scan Conversion Mode (multichannel or one channel) for regular group
 193:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) ADC Continuous Conversion Mode (Continuous or Single conversion) for 
 194:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           regular group
 195:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) External trigger Edge and source of regular group, 
 196:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Converted data alignment (left or right)
 197:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) The number of ADC conversions that will be done using the sequencer for 
 198:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           regular channel group
 199:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Multi ADC mode selection
 200:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Direct memory access mode selection for multi ADC mode  
 201:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Delay between 2 sampling phases (used in dual or triple interleaved modes)
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccMH9tzV.s 			page 5


 202:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Enable or disable the ADC peripheral   
 203:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @endverbatim
 204:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @{
 205:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   */
