 222:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /**
 223:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the ADCx peripheral according to the specified parameters 
 224:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *         in the ADC_InitStruct.
 225:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @note   This function is used to configure the global features of the ADC ( 
 226:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *         Resolution and Data Alignment), however, the rest of the configuration
