 419:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /** @defgroup ADC_Group2 Analog Watchdog configuration functions
 420:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *  @brief    Analog Watchdog configuration functions 
 421:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *
 422:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @verbatim   
 423:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 424:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              ##### Analog Watchdog configuration functions #####
 425:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 426:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] This section provides functions allowing to configure the Analog Watchdog
 427:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (AWD) feature in the ADC.
 428:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
 429:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] A typical configuration Analog Watchdog is done following these steps :
 430:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) the ADC guarded channel(s) is (are) selected using the 
 431:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_AnalogWatchdogSingleChannelConfig() function.
 432:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) The Analog watchdog lower and higher threshold are configured using the  
 433:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_AnalogWatchdogThresholdsConfig() function.
 434:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) The Analog watchdog is enabled and configured to enable the check, on one
 435:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           or more channels, using the  ADC_AnalogWatchdogCmd() function.
 436:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @endverbatim
 437:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @{
 438:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   */
 439:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
 440:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /**
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccMH9tzV.s 			page 15


 441:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @brief  Enables or disables the analog watchdog on single/all regular or 
 442:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *         injected channels
 443:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx: where x can be 1, 2 or 3 to select the ADC peripheral.
 444:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_AnalogWatchdog: the ADC analog watchdog configuration.
 445:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
 446:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_SingleRegEnable: Analog watchdog on a single regular channel
 447:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_SingleInjecEnable: Analog watchdog on a single injected chan
 448:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_SingleRegOrInjecEnable: Analog watchdog on a single regular 
 449:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_AllRegEnable: Analog watchdog on all regular channel
 450:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_AllInjecEnable: Analog watchdog on all injected channel
 451:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_AllRegAllInjecEnable: Analog watchdog on all regular and inj
 452:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_AnalogWatchdog_None: No channel guarded by the analog watchdog
 453:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @retval None	  
 454:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   */
