 548:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /** @defgroup ADC_Group3 Temperature Sensor, Vrefint (Voltage Reference internal) 
 549:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *            and VBAT (Voltage BATtery) management functions
 550:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *  @brief   Temperature Sensor, Vrefint and VBAT management functions 
 551:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *
 552:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @verbatim   
 553:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 554:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       ##### Temperature Sensor, Vrefint and VBAT management functions #####
 555:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 556:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] This section provides functions allowing to enable/ disable the internal 
 557:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          connections between the ADC and the Temperature Sensor, the Vrefint and 
 558:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          the Vbat sources.
 559:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      
 560:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] A typical configuration to get the Temperature sensor and Vrefint channels 
 561:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          voltages is done following these steps :
 562:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Enable the internal connection of Temperature sensor and Vrefint sources 
 563:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           with the ADC channels using ADC_TempSensorVrefintCmd() function. 
 564:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Select the ADC_Channel_TempSensor and/or ADC_Channel_Vrefint using 
 565:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_RegularChannelConfig() or  ADC_InjectedChannelConfig() functions 
 566:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Get the voltage values, using ADC_GetConversionValue() or  
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccMH9tzV.s 			page 19


 567:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_GetInjectedConversionValue().
 568:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
 569:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] A typical configuration to get the VBAT channel voltage is done following 
 570:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          these steps :
 571:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Enable the internal connection of VBAT source with the ADC channel using 
 572:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_VBATCmd() function. 
 573:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Select the ADC_Channel_Vbat using ADC_RegularChannelConfig() or  
 574:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_InjectedChannelConfig() functions 
 575:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Get the voltage value, using ADC_GetConversionValue() or  
 576:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           ADC_GetInjectedConversionValue().
 577:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  
 578:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @endverbatim
 579:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @{
 580:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   */
 581:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
 582:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
