 635:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /** @defgroup ADC_Group4 Regular Channels Configuration functions
 636:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *  @brief   Regular Channels Configuration functions 
 637:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *
 638:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @verbatim   
 639:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 640:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              ##### Regular Channels Configuration functions #####
 641:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 642:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
 643:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] This section provides functions allowing to manage the ADC's regular channels,
 644:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          it is composed of 2 sub sections : 
 645:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
 646:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Configuration and management functions for regular channels: This subsection 
 647:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           provides functions allowing to configure the ADC regular channels :    
 648:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) Configure the rank in the regular group sequencer for each channel
 649:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) Configure the sampling time for each channel
 650:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) select the conversion Trigger for regular channels
 651:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) select the desired EOC event behavior configuration
 652:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) Activate the continuous Mode  (*)
 653:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          (++) Activate the Discontinuous Mode 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccMH9tzV.s 			page 22


 654:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          -@@- Please Note that the following features for regular channels 
 655:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              are configured using the ADC_Init() function : 
 656:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            (+@@) scan mode activation 
 657:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            (+@@) continuous mode activation (**) 
 658:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            (+@@) External trigger source  
 659:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            (+@@) External trigger edge 
 660:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****            (+@@) number of conversion in the regular channels group sequencer.
 661:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      
 662:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          -@@- (*) and (**) are performing the same configuration
 663:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      
 664:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Get the conversion data: This subsection provides an important function in 
 665:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           the ADC peripheral since it returns the converted data of the current 
 666:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           regular channel. When the Conversion value is read, the EOC Flag is 
 667:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           automatically cleared.
 668:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****      
 669:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           -@- For multi ADC mode, the last ADC1, ADC2 and ADC3 regular conversions 
 670:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****               results data (in the selected multi mode) can be returned in the same 
 671:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****               time using ADC_GetMultiModeConversionValue() function. 
 672:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          
 673:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @endverbatim
 674:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @{
 675:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   */
 676:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /**
 677:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @brief  Configures for the selected ADC regular channel its corresponding
 678:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *         rank in the sequencer and its sample time.
 679:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx: where x can be 1, 2 or 3 to select the ADC peripheral.
 680:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_Channel: the ADC channel to configure. 
 681:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 682:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_0: ADC Channel0 selected
 683:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_1: ADC Channel1 selected
 684:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_2: ADC Channel2 selected
 685:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_3: ADC Channel3 selected
 686:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_4: ADC Channel4 selected
 687:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_5: ADC Channel5 selected
 688:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_6: ADC Channel6 selected
 689:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_7: ADC Channel7 selected
 690:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_8: ADC Channel8 selected
 691:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_9: ADC Channel9 selected
 692:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_10: ADC Channel10 selected
 693:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_11: ADC Channel11 selected
 694:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_12: ADC Channel12 selected
 695:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_13: ADC Channel13 selected
 696:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_14: ADC Channel14 selected
 697:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_15: ADC Channel15 selected
 698:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_16: ADC Channel16 selected
 699:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_17: ADC Channel17 selected
 700:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_Channel_18: ADC Channel18 selected                       
 701:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @param  Rank: The rank in the regular group sequencer.
 702:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *          This parameter must be between 1 to 16.
 703:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_SampleTime: The sample time value to be set for the selected channel. 
 704:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 705:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_SampleTime_3Cycles: Sample time equal to 3 cycles
 706:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *            @arg ADC_SampleTime_15Cycles: Sample time equal to 15 cycles
