1130:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] This section provide functions allowing to configure the ADC Injected channels,
1131:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          it is composed of 2 sub sections : 
1132:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     
1133:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Configuration functions for Injected channels: This subsection provides 
1134:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           functions allowing to configure the ADC injected channels :    
1135:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) Configure the rank in the injected group sequencer for each channel
1136:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) Configure the sampling time for each channel    
1137:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) Activate the Auto injected Mode  
1138:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) Activate the Discontinuous Mode 
1139:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) scan mode activation  
1140:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) External/software trigger source   
1141:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) External trigger edge 
1142:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (++) injected channels sequencer.
1143:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     
1144:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (#) Get the Specified Injected channel conversion data: This subsection 
1145:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           provides an important function in the ADC peripheral since it returns the 
1146:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****           converted data of the specific injected channel.
1147:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
1148:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @endverbatim
