1495:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** /** @defgroup ADC_Group7 Interrupts and flags management functions
1496:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *  @brief   Interrupts and flags management functions
1497:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  *
1498:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** @verbatim   
1499:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================
1500:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****             ##### Interrupts and flags management functions #####
1501:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****  ===============================================================================  
1502:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
1503:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] This section provides functions allowing to configure the ADC Interrupts 
1504:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****          and to get the status and clear flags and Interrupts pending bits.
1505:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
1506:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..] Each ADC provides 4 Interrupts sources and 6 Flags which can be divided
1507:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         into 3 groups:
1508:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
1509:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *** Flags and Interrupts for ADC regular channels ***
1510:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   =====================================================
1511:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]
1512:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Flags :
1513:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_FLAG_OVR : Overrun detection when regular converted data are lost
1514:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
1515:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_FLAG_EOC : Regular channel end of conversion ==> to indicate 
1516:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              (depending on EOCS bit, managed by ADC_EOCOnEachRegularChannelCmd() )
1517:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              the end of:
1518:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              (+++) a regular CHANNEL conversion 
1519:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              (+++) sequence of regular GROUP conversions .
1520:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
1521:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_FLAG_STRT: Regular channel start ==> to indicate when regular 
1522:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              CHANNEL conversion starts.
1523:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]
1524:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Interrupts :
1525:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_IT_OVR : specifies the interrupt source for Overrun detection 
1526:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              event.  
1527:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_IT_EOC : specifies the interrupt source for Regular channel end
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccMH9tzV.s 			page 57


1528:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              of conversion event.
1529:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
1530:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   
1531:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *** Flags and Interrupts for ADC Injected channels ***
1532:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   ======================================================
1533:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]
1534:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Flags :
1535:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_FLAG_JEOC : Injected channel end of conversion ==> to indicate 
1536:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              at the end of injected GROUP conversion  
1537:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****               
1538:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_FLAG_JSTRT: Injected channel start ==> to indicate hardware when 
1539:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              injected GROUP conversion starts.
1540:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]
1541:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+) Interrupts :
1542:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_IT_JEOC : specifies the interrupt source for Injected channel 
1543:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              end of conversion event.     
1544:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c **** 
1545:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   *** General Flags and Interrupts for the ADC ***
1546:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****   ================================================ 
1547:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]
1548:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****       (+)Flags :
1549:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****         (##) ADC_FLAG_AWD: Analog watchdog ==> to indicate if the converted voltage 
1550:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****              crosses the programmed thresholds values.
1551:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_adc.c ****     [..]          
